            "@type": "Answer",
            "text": "The accuracy of a likeability test depends on how honestly you answer and how well the test is designed. Assessments that use psychometric methodologies — like this likeable person test — are more accurate than simple yes/no quizzes. No test fully captures your personality; your mood, self-awareness, and candor all influence results. Think of your likability score as a map of your behavioral patterns, not a permanent verdict."
